Nothing needed from you. The frozen-compressor campaign is on track, and the first split-test verdict should come in tonight.

**Done this wake**
- **Connector frozen, seed 42** (only the connector is frozen; the compressor and decoder still train): a quarter of the way through training (0.23 epoch), its held-out loss is 0.438. That is lower than the reference finetune at the same point (0.513), the fully frozen run (0.455) and the compressor-frozen run (0.459). It is healthy. This is a 64-row loss, so it decides nothing.
- I copied that quarter-way checkpoint (checked byte-identical) before training deletes it at step 300. I launched the allowed quick check: an eval with the judge on the first 300 document questions.
- The shared eval queue cleared about a day early. First unpaired numbers for **compressor frozen, seed 42** (1,500 questions each, judge accuracy ↑):

| set | compressor frozen | fully frozen | reference |
|---|---|---|---|
| MRQA text (gating) | .695 | .695 | .718 |
| HotpotQA (not gating) | .583 | .575 | .603 |

These fit the earlier prediction that freezing only the compressor fails like freezing everything. They decide nothing until the paired test runs.
- I queued that paired test: it compares the same questions answered by each model, both seeds, all four sets, against both the reference and the fully frozen runs. It starts automatically when the 6 remaining compressor-frozen evals finish, around 19:30.
- **Connector frozen, seed 43** started at 17:42, 11 hours before the scheduler's estimate. Its log confirms the connector is frozen.

**Next**
- I wake when the connector-frozen seed-43 quarter-way checkpoint appears (about 20:20), or in 4 hours at most.
- At that wake: read the compressor-frozen verdict, read the seed-42 quick check, and copy the seed-43 checkpoint for its own quick check.

**Small open item:** the new freeze setting in `pisco/model.py` and `test_freeze.py` is still uncommitted. This campaign cannot commit `pisco/`. One of your chats should commit it when convenient; nothing is blocked meanwhile.
